WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:08.240
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and Arrow is
back, there was a lot of stuff from the Premiere

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.690
to talk about so this will be a top 10 and
my review.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.620
But I’ll circle back around and try to hit
everything that happened.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:18.420
And don’t worry I’ll also be doing a q&amp;a
for both the flash and arrow tomorrow.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.550
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.820
I’ll wait just a sec...Okay, here we go.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.120
Top 10 Moments

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.170
Number 10 - Team Arrow has been kicking ass
and taking names

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.000
Ever since the season 2 finale Oliver and
Team Arrow have been systematically taking

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.170
down organized crime.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:42.480
The opening action scene is just an example
of how they’ve basically been steamrolling

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.859
every bad guy they can find.

00:00:43.859 --> 00:00:47.789
And we get to see Roy roll into action in
his shiny new costume

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:51.819
Number 9 - Roy Harper is full on Arsenal

00:00:51.819 --> 00:00:56.260
Stephen Amell joked at comic con that he now
had the second best suit on the show.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.300
Roy’s does look pretty badass.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.019
This is what it looks like when it’s not
super dark out.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:05.519
It’s funny that it’s super cool but you
can’t really see a lot of the details, because

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:07.070
they always shoot it at night.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:11.060
And for those asking, yes Roy is going to
be the Arsenal version of his character.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:12.140
Not Red Arrow.

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:18.200
Number 8 - The Hong Kong Flashbacks

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:23.039
Amanda Waller is trying to get Oliver to work
for her as if he were a Suicide Squad member.

00:01:23.039 --> 00:01:27.049
They haven’t used that term to describe
what he’s doing, but you can think of it

00:01:27.049 --> 00:01:29.619
as a precursor to the Suicide Squad.

00:01:29.619 --> 00:01:32.979
Oliver’s Handlers are Tatsu and Maseo.

00:01:32.979 --> 00:01:35.540
In the comics, Tatsu, the wife, becomes Katana.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:39.630
I’ve already done a big video explaining
her character that I’ll link in the description.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:45.329
She’s probably going to be one of the flashback
characters that shows up in the future.

00:01:45.329 --> 00:01:53.840
The actress that plays her Rila Fukushima
played Yukio in The Wolverine.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.390
Number 7 - Quentin Unofficially joins Team
Arrow

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:00.183
He’s Captain Lance now and it looks like
he’s been helping oliver hunt down criminals

00:02:00.183 --> 00:02:05.789
in the field for a while.

00:02:05.789 --> 00:02:09.509
Obviously this episode brought some of those
extracurricular activities into question,

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:10.509
he’s back in the hospital.

00:02:10.509 --> 00:02:12.379
But his speech with Laurel at the end was
basically him saying, my choice.

00:02:12.379 --> 00:02:13.819
I’m not stopping.

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:16.420
Just like Diggle.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:24.400
He’ll be working more directly with Oliver
this year and for some reason he’ll be bald.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:31.150
I think that’s just because he has to wear
the captain’s hat and they thought it looked

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:36.200
silly with his hair.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.120
Number 6 - Meet the New Vertigo

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.390
Peter Stormare makes for great villains.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:45.823
He’s playing a villain on the Blacklist
right now which I think is a funny coincidence.

00:02:45.823 --> 00:02:55.140
If you’re confused, he’s just taking up
the mantle 

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:59.020
of Vertigo even though the Count died.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.269
That was what his “Something’s never die”
speech was about.

00:03:01.269 --> 00:03:09.330
He’s just going to be one of the mid-level
villains this year like Brother Blood was

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.569
last year.

00:03:10.569 --> 00:03:13.430
The drug just brings out you’re biggest
fears.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:17.110
I thought it was a bit silly to have Oliver
take another shot in the chest the second

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.110
time they fought.

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:26.050
I feel like he would have worn thicker body
armor after the first encounter.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:30.630
Number 5 - Felicity Works in a Buy More

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:42.250
Neither she or Oliver work at Queen Consolidated
right now.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.840
So Felicity is working tech support to earn
money.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.340
The Brandon Routh intro was just a wink to
him being on Chuck.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:51.670
He actually played a villain on that show,
I think it’s all on Netflix if any of you

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.790
haven’t seen it.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:58.209
Since Brandon Routh is buying half of Oliver’s
company, they all might be working there again

00:03:58.209 --> 00:03:59.209
really soon.

00:03:59.209 --> 00:04:06.510
Most of his scenes will be with Felicity for
the first half of the season.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.080
Number 4 - Ray Palmer Has A Plan to Save the
City

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:27.680
As you can tell, he’s supposed to be the
Atom from the comic books before he became

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.680
the Atom.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.840
Yes, he will get a suit and he will fight
the villains with Team Arrow.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:37.820
Brandon Routh said a month ago he’d seen
concept art for the suit and at the time they’d

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.189
only shot about 6 episodes.

00:04:39.189 --> 00:04:42.520
So I’m thinking we’ll see the Atom Suit
in the mid-season finale.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.509
The Arrow half of that episode, it’s a two
parter.

00:04:45.509 --> 00:04:48.570
Is Called The Brave and The Bold.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:52.500
So they’re basically doing Justice League
on TV.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.199
Everyone can flip out about how cool that
is.

00:04:56.199 --> 00:05:00.479
The other big half of his speech is about
re-branding Starling City as Star City.

00:05:00.479 --> 00:05:02.360
That’s what it’s called in the comics.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.750
The name starling is just something they changed
for the show.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:09.639
I’m kind of wondering if they planned things
this way all along.

00:05:09.639 --> 00:05:13.070
Like showing how Starling became Star City.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.550
Just to address the 400 pound gorilla in the
room.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:18.560
Yes, Ray Palmer will come between Oliver and
Felicity.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:24.680
But I think when you guys see their scenes,
you’ll enjoy it.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:31.630
Felicity is just going to have a few more
options available to her.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.990
We even saw her kissing grant gustin in a
Flash Promo.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.110
She’s got superhero’s beating down her
door to go on dates now.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.699
Number 3 - Diggle and Lyla have a baby

00:05:39.699 --> 00:05:42.509
I did not expect this to go down in the first
episode.

00:05:42.509 --> 00:05:45.479
They’ll get some of their own Suicide Squad
episodes this season.

00:05:45.479 --> 00:05:50.830
As for the baby, I don’t know what their
plan is to incorporate it into the story.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:56.660
It’s a huge deal, but because filming with
babies is very difficult, they probably just

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.710
won’t show it a lot.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.069
Number 2 - Sara is Killed

00:06:03.069 --> 00:06:08.540
The person that shot her is Komodo, one of
the other mid-level villains.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.090
For all intents and purposes she’s dead.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.699
Or at least they want us to think that.

00:06:12.699 --> 00:06:15.100
With the black canary mask rolling of onto
the ground.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.770
It’s a giant call to action for Laurel this
season.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.539
If you haven’t seen the pictures, Kate Cassidy
has been posting pictures of her workouts.

00:06:21.539 --> 00:06:22.840
She’s pretty hardcore.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.370
She’s giving stephen amell a run for his
money.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.860
If you remember the boxing scene.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.000
One of the fighters was JR Ramirez, he’s
playing Wildcat.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.729
He’ll be getting some scenes with Laurel
soon.

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:39.350
So it’s possible he could train her to fight.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:44.300
I’m not expecting Laurel Black Canary this
season, but it seems like they’re definitely

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.499
implying it’s going to happen soon.

00:06:46.499 --> 00:06:49.860
and my Number 1 moment - All of the Olicity

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:56.190
This was like everyone’s fan fiction made
reality, but they take it all back at the

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.190
end of the episode.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.660
They’re not going to keep on dating.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.419
Felicity pretty much said that they were done
as a couple.

00:07:01.419 --> 00:07:05.509
It sucks, but that doesn’t mean they’ll
never end up together.

00:07:05.509 --> 00:07:10.770
Like I said though, she’s got a ship with
Grant Gustin and Brandon Routh.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:13.130
So Felicity will be getting a lot of attention.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.889
Oliver on the other hand will probably be
spending a lot of time brooding.

00:07:15.889 --> 00:07:17.330
It seemed like he was completely turned off
from the idea of relationships.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.389
So I don’t think we’ll be seeing a lot
of hookups from him.

00:07:18.389 --> 00:07:20.950
There are a couple big things we did not see
in this episode.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:25.730
Ra’s Al Ghul, Komodo, or at least his face,
and Team Merlyn.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:36.110
The next episode is called Sara, so it will
directly follow up on that last scene.

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.470
Let me know though, what was your favorite
moment and what do you think of Brandon Routh

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:49.069
so far?

00:07:49.069 --> 00:08:10.840
Most of 

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:20.009
the people we missed will show up by the fourth
episode, Including Ra’s Al Ghul.

00:08:20.009 --> 00:08:31.199
So Arrow 

00:08:31.199 --> 00:08:40.600
just like The Flash, is wasting no time in
getting things going.

00:08:40.600 --> 00:09:13.470
Overall I gave The Episode a solid B plus.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:20.400
It’s my new favorite Arrow premiere.

